EXECUTION Observe actual implementation effects and raw fields, distinguishing input, internal completion and externally effective return. Declare legal inputs, actual controls and observation adaptations for this check's endpoint. A local comparison need not establish unrelated deployment consequences. Missing capability, compilation failure, timeout, panic and a completed property comparison are distinct outcomes; retain logs and attribution gaps. Never emit expected failures as precomputed observations or alter protocol behavior to create a finding.

CORRELATION Harness.prerequisites contains prerequisite events only; monitors select independent result events. ObservableProperty.identity_fields declares the stable operation identity once, using fields present at the relevant observation points. Do not repeat a result as a prerequisite or duplicate each identity equality as a Comparison. Reference conditions declare necessary predecessor relationships; unrelated prerequisites have no implicit list order. Assertions may refer to any declared prerequisite alias that actually precedes the result. Missing identity/reference fields or nonunique associations remain unknown. Each operation is matched separately. Use independent identity, not the compared value, to associate an input and output. A context expected to change cannot also be an equality filter. More complex histories need an explicit model route or a stated limitation.

MEANING Record actual comparisons in properties/outcome and scope or applicability limitations separately. Generate uncertainties for unresolved contracts, counterevidence, input legality and observation differences; execution status comes from CheckRun, not persistent prose such as uncompiled or not yet executed. An implementation/requirement discrepancy is the subject of investigation, not itself a conflict between the sources establishing the requirement. Real contradictions remain conflicts. No keyword cleanup or an extra review merely removes an execution-status note.

CONFIRMATION Review a direct check as a whole against its accepted obligation, actual calls, adaptations, event parsing, correlated prerequisites and independent oracle. A completed measured comparison survives wider-history and excluded-consequence limits, but cannot establish a broader consequence; missing correspondence keeps attribution pending without erasing the measurement. Judge instrumentation and substitutes from the supplied code and stopping point instead of a language-specific syntax rule. For model replay, automatic confirmation also requires compatible actual calibration and the supported common property encoding; equal checker IDs alone are insufficient. Stable-support histories must match observed events, with identity/context chosen from the actual contract. Unsupported expressions or incomplete histories remain gaps. Preserve unresolved semantic disputes. Unreached prerequisites permit F4; changed behavior/mapping requires F1; disputed meaning requires F2; missing producer/filter scope requires F3. Tool, parser and framework failures are not semantic feedback.

Return DirectCheckReply for the selected direct_test or controlled_schedule question using the advertised harness kind and actual target calls. Select one accepted obligation; the controller associates the accepted AuditUnit scope, so do not restate or narrow it. Record concrete inputs and adaptations in the harness. Each EventRequirement constrains only its named event and may have no conditions when occurrence is sufficient. Supply shared observable_properties of kind=event_assertion; its trigger selects applicable result events, identity_fields correlate them with prerequisites, and each EventMonitor may add conditions on that same result event. Never use the assertion field as a trigger or applicability filter. A grounded independent oracle compares actual input/output fields, including a named prerequisite alias. Unsupported history properties use local_model fallback.

Before proposing a controlled schedule, explain what existing interfaces actually control and observe. Sleeps, bypassed locks and an assumed transport order do not establish control. Missing capabilities use a specific gap and local_model/source_review fallback; missing dependencies use precise requests. reading_purpose=dependency reconnects scope through F3; context reads assemble the current check.

